Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Foggy Intersection with Rain" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .
:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk2 .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition ;
    :description "Heavy rain reducing visibility and creating hazardous conditions" .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to rain and fog" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :WeatherRisk ;
    :description "Hazardous driving conditions due to severe weather" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.80"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Reduced visibility due to rain and fog
Severity Score: 0.75

Risk 2:
Description: Hazardous driving conditions due to severe weather
Severity Score: 0.80